# Allowlist .gitignore — this repo is a PUBLIC payload mirror.
# Only files a door actually downloads may be committed here.
# Anything else (docs/, src/, index.html, *.ts, tools/, workers/) is ignored
# even if someone dumps the private repo tree into this clone.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!boot-manifest.json
!manifest.json
!boot-*.webp
!assets/
!assets/*.pack
